<!-- Hero -->
<div class='hero'>
  <img src='cid:profile-hero' alt='KCF children' width='600' />
</div>

<div class='section'>
  <h1 class='title'>Let's Find Your Little Bestie</h1>

  <div class='letter'>
    <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>Help us understand what matters most to you so we can create the perfect
      match. Every child is unique, and your preferences will help us find the
      child whose journey will resonate with your heart.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Preferences -->
  <h2 class='section-title'>Tell Us About Your Preferences</h2>
  <div class='steps'>
    <table
      role='presentation'
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      class='step'
    >
      <tr>
        <td width='40' valign='top' style='padding-right:16px;'><div
            class='step-num'
          >1</div></td>
        <td valign='top' class='step-body'>
          <h3>Child Interests</h3>
          <p>Do you have a preference for a child who loves sports, arts,
            science, or music? We'll match you with someone who shares your
            passions.</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <table
      role='presentation'
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      class='step'
    >
      <tr>
        <td width='40' valign='top' style='padding-right:16px;'><div
            class='step-num'
          >2</div></td>
        <td valign='top' class='step-body'>
          <h3>School Goals</h3>
          <p>Would you like to support a child in primary school, secondary
            school, or pursuing specific educational dreams?</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <table
      role='presentation'
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      class='step'
    >
      <tr>
        <td width='40' valign='top' style='padding-right:16px;'><div
            class='step-num'
          >3</div></td>
        <td valign='top' class='step-body'>
          <h3>Hobbies and Talents</h3>
          <p>From storytelling to football, every child has unique gifts. Tell
            us what inspires you.</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <table
      role='presentation'
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      class='step'
    >
      <tr>
        <td width='40' valign='top' style='padding-right:16px;'><div
            class='step-num'
          >4</div></td>
        <td valign='top' class='step-body'>
          <h3>Communication Preferences</h3>
          <p>How would you like to stay connected? Monthly letters, video
            messages, photos, or regular updates.</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  {{#if temporaryPassword}}
    <!-- Login details, first-time only -->
    <div class='story-card'>
      <h2>Your Sponsor Portal Login</h2>
      <p>Email:
        <a href='mailto:{{email}}' style='color:#fff; text-decoration:underline;'>{{email}}</a></p>
      <p>Temporary password: {{temporaryPassword}}</p>
    </div>
  {{/if}}

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class='cta-wrap'>
    <a href='{{loginUrl}}' class='cta'>Complete Your Sponsorship Profile</a>
  </div>

  <div class='letter'>
    <p>Once we find your match, you'll receive a comprehensive digital
      sponsorship pack — a sponsorship guide, a welcome pack introducing your
      child, and a sponsorship agreement outlining our safeguarding measures.
      Your sponsored child's safety is our top priority: every interaction is
      monitored by our safeguarding team, with full financial transparency and
      certified child-protection policies.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Signoff -->
  <p class='signoff'>
    We're excited to help you find your perfect match,<br />
    <span class='team'>The Kwizera Team</span>
  </p>
</div>